Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 19:40:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] fix(coding-agent): keep focus current through history and
 session changes

Reconcile retained display history at lifecycle boundaries, preserve transformed live completions, reset session-local pending output, and refresh focused rendering inputs.

Validation: 109 affected tests and npm run check pass. The isolated full suite was run; unrelated import, clipboard, documentation, timeout, and earlier fixture failures remain.
